        "The storyteller queen tells a new tale every night. She's told a thousand. Never run out.",
        "A man in the market sells flying carpets. They don't fly. He says that's because you haven't believed hard enough.",
        "Rub a lamp in this city and something might come out. Usually it's just dust. Usually.",
