        "Children here learn to ride a horse before they can walk properly. Very wobbly walkers. Excellent riders.",
        "The eagle hunters train golden eagles. The eagle sits on your arm. Wear a very thick glove.",
        "The sky here is so big and so blue. Nothing but grass to the edge of the world, and sky on top.",
        "Throat singing! One person, two notes at once. Like the wind and the mountain singing together.",
        "In winter it's so cold the milk freezes in the bucket. We eat it like ice cream.",
